    "description": "You are purchasing a \"Mixed Rock and Mineral Collection Lot with Agate Slices\" in \"Used\" condition.\nColorful mixed lot of rocks, minerals, and agate slices—perfect for collectors, crafters, educators, or anyone who loves natural stone. This unique bundle includes a wide variety of pieces, from rough rock specimens to polished tumbled stones and vibrant agate slices. You’ll see multiple shapes, sizes, and colors, along with a bag of mixed stones and a small display box of polished pieces. There is also a rectangular stone block with an animal outline and a printed information card for a Brazilian agate piece. Whether you tumble rocks, wire-wrap jewelry, teach geology, or just enjoy displaying interesting stones, this lot gives you an instant, varied collection with plenty to sort, study, and use in projects. Highlights: - Assorted tumbled stones in multiple colors - Rough rocks and mineral pieces with natural texture - Several polished agate slices in bright and neutral tones - One stone display box with polished stones - One larger stone block with an animal outline and info card - One bag filled with mixed stones for sorting or crafting Great for rock enthusiasts, classroom kits, craft projects, or decorating bowls, terrariums, and shelves. Keywords: rock collection, mixed stones lot, tumbled stones, agate slices, mineral specimens, rock hound, geology kit, craft stones, decorative rocks\nCondition Notes:\nMixed lot of assorted rocks, minerals, and tumbled stones with visible handling wear. Some rough stones have chipped edges and natural surface irregularities. Tumbled stones appear generally smooth with minor scuffs. Agate slices show clean cuts with some edge wear and small surface scratches. The plastic display box has light surface wear and small marks. The bag of mixed stones shows no visible tears but is creased from handling. The carved rectangular stone block and other larger pieces show small nicks and surface scratches consistent with age and use.\nAspects:",
